# Density Compare
# Actinium (Ac) — real density 10.07 g/cm³. equal masses: Actinium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Actinium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 9.3mm color: #007fff at (-20mm, 4.6mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 80.3 g — the water cube is the reference
